    {
      "kind": "draft_claim",
      "id": "draft-claim-draft-d31ddc0d-2bb1-45fd-b7e5-1718c910b98c-r2-1",
      "text": "林默走进北门。",
      "sha256": "e4176f286a3ddb9f942263869e400c8c74ea13a68e2dbcbe3ed73505c7823393"
    },
    {
      "kind": "draft_claim",
      "id": "draft-claim-draft-d31ddc0d-2bb1-45fd-b7e5-1718c910b98c-r2-2",
      "text": "林默走进北门。",
      "sha256": "e4176f286a3ddb9f942263869e400c8c74ea13a68e2dbcbe3ed73505c7823393"
    },
    {
      "kind": "source_span",
      "id": "span-0e884301-d38a-4e65-ac7e-bcb65876b85e",
      "chapter_id": "ch-35230d99-1241-498f-8064-c1b70d0ce9e2",
      "chapter_number": 6,
      "source_revision": 1,
      "text": "电台在二十一点零五分收到三次短促求救码，信号来自雾线水门以外。",
      "sha256": "2d354cc208c312f81f0d4d72c682603571b1edd1bfaf6bcf3561e4e04a22dc6a"
    },
    {
      "kind": "source_span",
      "id": "span-134eb42a-7fd2-44c1-88b3-015bbf990b61",
      "chapter_id": "ch-1a42da5b-7bcc-49a8-b608-ddfeab3262a2",
      "chapter_number": 10,
      "source_revision": 1,
      "text": "北潮闸并未关闭，雾钟却响了一次；温岚仍握着罗盘，港外传来白色渡船的汽笛。",
      "sha256": "183759380df3c5c073ba0256d25ae7426cb03fc193282a5f791b26586f45103b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "source_span",
      "id": "span-176c71ef-298e-4038-a194-d76695a3a922",
      "chapter_id": "ch-30698e6b-23cd-4835-bf8c-d8d1c866867d",
      "chapter_number": 9,
      "source_revision": 1,
      "text": "进入仓道前，苏岑把带月牙裂纹的黄铜罗盘交到温岚手里保管。",
      "sha256": "c118f3d296dfb8d143c3b0b5467637a24e73f833356f845d5d5c7596956d88a5"
    },
    {
      "kind": "source_span",
      "id": "span-5f821ac4-a020-4243-8606-ce732c0fa7f6",
      "chapter_id": "ch-ad520c76-1041-4522-aa1e-c023a83d0739",
      "chapter_number": 8,
      "source_revision": 1,
      "text": "温岚把北堤值守簿交给苏岑，两人约定不再各自隐瞒新线索。",
      "sha256": "356f1372376d61df6ed9af380f9c17ca332b58e5d8e09396df79e419eb5fd18a"
    },
    {
      "kind": "memory_record",
      "id": "mem-126427a8-0416-4d72-a402-4eb9c1b6909c",
      "source_span_id": "span-134eb42a-7fd2-44c1-88b3-015bbf990b61",
      "text": "北潮闸未关闭时响起，原因未解",
      "sha256": "5a1ecc11587f240902b67617d5fcba571f254dc1dff4ddacd9b13321ea989b70"
    },
    {
      "kind": "memory_record",
      "id": "mem-64830c7d-fa0b-4974-80e1-91bb0896a0ee",
      "source_span_id": "span-6c5e9ba2-ed37-40b7-978b-4247059890ae",
      "text": "只在北潮闸完全关闭后敲响一次",
      "sha256": "b1d239266968026fc4ef7041f32af6dabaff05fb624ba424e4693ea98dc124b5"
    },
    {
      "kind": "memory_record",
      "id": "mem-67d10c9b-645b-4bd8-a005-a49f30a5d9d2",
      "source_span_id": "span-176c71ef-298e-4038-a194-d76695a3a922",
      "text": "温岚",
      "sha256": "2fdb67447992579f8f9f0c751e36d69fbcaba84c43b2318b010edec750ef1c1b"
    },
    {
      "kind": "memory_record",
      "id": "mem-af05b38a-7678-46e6-a868-1193802fa060",
      "source_span_id": "span-55619839-19d6-4b73-9f42-9acdad872f2f",
      "text": "廊桥钥匙的含义",
      "sha256": "3d99a1a224bc211b22a638a8f187cd974662fc52736efc569d231bb77aa798ff"
    },
    {
      "kind": "memory_record",
      "id": "mem-bcd865b7-7700-4b2e-8764-f6023216b5a2",
